/**
 * A grooming preview is read-only. It used to call seedUatRoster, which wrote a 9-row batch on EVERY east preview
 * (the runtime groomers groom_arun/groom_kiran/groom_sanjay have no published availability on staging).
 * This answers with exactly the rows that write would have produced - same dates, window, authored-wins
 * rule and INSERT OR IGNORE semantics (an existing row keeps its place) - held in memory for this request.
 * Only providers the governed matcher returned are asked about, and all of them match the seeder's filter.
