   * window. Ranking every pet_taxi profile gave rides to drivers with no car at all (uatcap_taxi_ft, taxi_imran),
   * and the booking then told the customer no Citroen eC3 was free while one was. The read needs only the city and
   * window, so it starts here, beside the provider reads, and adds no round trip. */
  const taxiDrivers=input.serviceCode==="pet_taxi"?taxiDriversWithFreeCar(db,{cityId,scheduledStart:input.scheduledStart,scheduledEnd:input.scheduledEnd,vehicleClass:input.vehicleClass}):null;taxiDrivers?.catch(()=>undefined);
